Description:It is your first main phase. You control Chasm Guide (3/2 Ally; rally: whenever it or another Ally enters, creatures you control gain haste) and have a second Chasm Guide in hand with four red mana floating. The opponent is at 6 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
